# Python Rules (FastAPI + Pydantic + PyTorch)

## 🏗️ Structure
```
service/
├── src/service_name/
│   ├── main.py              # FastAPI app
│   ├── api/                 # Routes
│   ├── models/              # ML models
│   ├── services/            # Business logic
│   ├── schemas/             # Pydantic models
│   ├── core/                # config, logging, security
│   └── db/                  # Database
├── tests/
└── notebooks/               # Research
```

## 📐 Naming (PEP 8)
- Module/file: snake_case
- Class: PascalCase
- Function/variable: snake_case
- Constant: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
- Private: _prefix
- Exception: PascalCase + Error suffix

## ✅ MUST
- Type hints EVERYWHERE (NO untyped functions)
- Use Pydantic models cho request/response
- Use Pydantic Settings cho config
- Use structlog cho structured logging
- Use `async def` cho I/O operations
- Use `from typing import` cho complex types
- Custom exception hierarchy (BusinessError)
- Global exception handlers trong FastAPI
- Use `Optional[T]` không dùng default `None` cho non-Optional
- Use pytest + pytest-asyncio cho test

## ❌ NEVER
- `print()` trong production
- Missing type hints
- Mutable default arguments (`def f(items=[])`)
- Bare except
- Wildcard imports (`from module import *`)
- `Any` type (dùng specific types)
- Magic numbers
- Hardcoded secrets, paths
- Comment lặp lại code

## 🧪 Test
- pytest + pytest-asyncio
- pytest-cov cho coverage
- Use AsyncMock cho async functions
- Use Factory Boy cho test data
- Coverage ≥ 80%

## 🧠 ML Specific
- PyTorch models phải có docstring mô tả kiến trúc
- Inference: dùng `@torch.no_grad()` decorator
- Batch processing cho efficiency
- Save/load model state_dict (KHÔNG pickle toàn bộ)
- Use ONNX hoặc TensorRT cho production inference
- Track experiments với MLflow hoặc W&B

